## How to Add New Attributions

When adding new stencil libraries or dependencies, add entries to this file
following the format above. Use the following template:

```
### [Name] ([stencil_id])
- **Provider**: [Company/Author]
- **URL**: [Source URL]
- **License**: [License name and reference]
- **Copyright**: [Copyright holder and year]
- **Attribution Required**: [Yes/No]
```

